          "en": "As he ﷺ neared Madinah on his return he said: [\"In Madinah there are people who were with you on every journey you made and every valley you crossed\"](h:bukhari:4423). They said: O Messenger of Allah, while they were in Madinah? He said: [\"While they were in Madinah; a genuine excuse held them back.\"](h:bukhari:4423)"
