          "id": "truth-3",
          "type": "prose",
          "ar": "فقال كعب: [«يا رسول الله، إنَّ الله إنما نجَّاني بالصدق، وإنَّ من توبتي ألَّا أُحدِّث إلا صدقًا ما بقيت»](h:bukhari:4418).",
          "en": "Ka'b said: [\"O Messenger of Allah, Allah saved me only through truthfulness, and part of my repentance is that I will speak nothing but the truth as long as I live.\"](h:bukhari:4418)"
