          "en": "The excuses of those who stayed behind were accepted outwardly and their secrets left to Allah[^bukhari:4418]. Ka'b told the truth, and at first the truth was harder on him; then Allah revealed Qur'an about him that is still recited, and said right after it: [﴿O you who believe, fear Allah and be with the truthful.﴾](q:9:119)"
